"             ╭ KEYS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮             "
"             │ Playback                    General                           Playlist                     │             "
"             │   Space  Play / pause                   /  Find                     a  Queue               │             "
"             │       n  Next track                     H  History                  A  Play next           │             "
"             │       p  Previous track                 ,  Settings                 x  Remove from queue   │             "
"             │       h  Seek back 10s                  L  Library folder     Shift+↑  Move up in queue    │             "
"             │       l  Seek forward 10s      ? / Ctrl+K  Toggle this help   Shift+↓  Move down in queue  │             "
"             │       ←  Seek back 5s                   q  Quit                     o  Cycle sort          │             "
"             │       →  Seek forward 5s    Navigation                              f  Favorite            │             "
"             │ Shift+←  Seek back 30s              j / ↓  Down                     d  Delete (asks first) │             "
"             │ Shift+→  Seek forward 30s           k / ↑  Up                       S  Save playlist       │             "
"             │   + / =  Volume up              gg / Home  Top                      R  Rescan              │             "
"             │   - / _  Volume down              G / End  Bottom                   i  Track info          │             "
"             │       s  Toggle shuffle     PgDn / Ctrl+D  Page down                                       │             "
"             │       r  Cycle repeat       PgUp / Ctrl+U  Page up                                         │             "
"             │       z  Sleep timer                Enter  Play selected                                   │             "
"             │       b  A-B repeat                                                                        │             "
"             │       [  Speed down                                                                        │             "
"             │       ]  Speed up                                                                          │             "
"             │  Ctrl+J  Jump to time                                                                      │             "
"             │     0-9  Seek to N×10%                                                                     │             "
